                                "example_id": "64061b08-0b83-47b8-b5fe-8d8346c66035",
                                "sense_id": "0d06ebe9-4273-3f72-a4bc-0da8429634dd",
                                "text": "A third man, Rodolfo Godinez, 24, a legal resident who immigrated from Nicaragua, and three teenagers also face murder and robbery charges for the shooting deaths of Iofemi Hightower, 20; Dashon Harvey, 20; and Terrance Aeriel, 18, on Aug. 4 behind the Mount Vernon School. Mr. Aeriel’s sister Natasha, 19, was also shot, but survived."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a0ce7b2-e112-450d-8943-d5a0065f9b18",
                                "sense_id": "0d06ebe9-4273-3f72-a4bc-0da8429634dd",
                                "text": "It’s telling that Otto Hightower dubs the late king “Viserys the Peaceful” because the flip side of his near-bloodless 26-year reign is the brutal civil war that will follow. […] It’s as grand a spectacle as the Hightowers (and House of the Dragon’s VFX team) can cook up, as thousands of bodies are packed into the Dragonpit to await Aegon’s arrival."
                            }
                        ]
